Text: Quarterly Reports – Mining Exploration Reporting Entities. A Mining Exploration Reporting Entity must disclose a report for each quarter of its financial year containing the following information in respect of the Mining Exploration Reporting Entity and all controlled entities, on a consolidated basis, if applicable:
